stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING : run persisted
  PENDING --> RUNNING : claim run
  RUNNING --> PENDING : lease reclaimed / run reset to PENDING
  RUNNING --> COMPLETED : validated results and patterns committed atomically
  RUNNING --> FAILED : execution/persistence fails
  RUNNING --> TIMED_OUT : execution deadline exceeded
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  TIMED_OUT --> [*]
